  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4971c5eb32d68c6419c2b82ec69e3fa3, type: 3}
  m_Name: ConvoStareOne
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: ConvoStareOne
  dialogueLines:
  - The player has been staring at this worker for quite a while. You good?
  - The player has been looking at this workers conversation for an awfully long
    time. Everything alright?
  - "The player hasn\u2019t stopped listening to this conversation. Is there something
    they\u2019re waiting for?"
  - The player has been watching this conversation for a while now. Perhaps they
    should go elsewhere.
  - The player has been listening to this conversation for quite some time. Surely
    they have something else to do.
  - "The player hasn\u2019t moved their gaze in a while. Perhaps it\u2019s time to
    do something else."
  - The player has been listening to these workers for ages. Maybe give them some
    privacy?
  - These men appear to be deep in conversation. The player, meanwhile, appears to
    be listening in.
  - The player has spent a surprisingly long time listening in to this conversation.
    Everything okay?
  canRepeat: 1
